  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Adaptive Actions for Food Security in Sindh (CAAFSS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Islamic Relief Pakistan. The project aims at enhanced climate adaptation and improved resilience of vulnerable farming communities with focus on sustainable food production in District Thatta, Sindh Province. The project will contribute to sustainable and climate resilient food production systems of the targeted farming communities, and improve advisory services on climate adaptive farming available to farmers including an enabling policy environment ensuring gender equality and inclusion of persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
